ik. Kamu bisa rejoin jika disconnect saat sedang di game","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-03770213e524f9cd6406ed7b231b0048/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3819bcd85edfd4e127224344d1a82c8e/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7c2334890f3371e6d4094deb220c6d96/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}